      "writtenOn": "2024-11-11T14:58:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: It what sense is this the _default_ algorithm vs the _only_ algorithm? If this library is only going to do ed25519 as this constant suggests then either inline it or avoid naming this constant in a way that makes it sound like the algorithm can change.",
      "revId": "8f0de0734f023d57de93307f17b36b102b57d236",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9bbfecbd_95d12a36",
        "filename": "libs/dice/open_dice/src/dice.rs",
